# Typing in an edit box: the description of a saved mission, with a letter
# taken back and Return to save. The load dialog then lists the mission, and
# the delete dialog takes it away again.
at 301 click 320 231
at 341 key RETURN
at 401 click 260 228
at 500 key ESC
at 521 click 320 160
at 560 shot save_dialog
at 561 type ABC
at 580 shot typed
at 581 key BACKSPACE
at 590 type 12
at 600 shot corrected
at 601 key RETURN
at 660 shot saved
at 661 key ESC
at 700 shot options_menu
at 701 click 320 140
at 740 shot load_dialog
at 741 key ESC
at 781 click 320 180
at 820 shot delete_dialog
at 821 key RETURN
at 860 shot delete_confirm
at 861 key RETURN
at 901 click 320 140
at 940 shot nothing_to_load
at 941 quit
